    "body": "As a parameter, it would let WebAssembly.Module define the \"throw if serializing for storage if not in a secure context\" behavior we've discussed elsewhere (rather than doing that in IDB as a post-serialize pass). Although maybe we can do that with prose just as easily. \"A module is not serializable for storage if the context is not a secure context.\"",
